## File Structure

The app is intentionally a single file with no build step, no npm, no dependencies. Open `index.html` directly in a browser and it works.

---

## Calculations

| Target | Formula |
|---|---|
| BMR | Mifflin-St Jeor (gender-adjusted) |
| TDEE | BMR × activity multiplier |
| Calories (loss) | TDEE − 500 kcal |
| Calories (gain) | TDEE + 300 kcal |
| Protein | 2.2g per kg bodyweight |
| Fat | 25% of total calories |
| Carbs | Remaining calories |
| Water | 35ml per kg bodyweight |
| Steps | 10,000 (loss) / 7,000 (gain) / 8,000 (maintenance) |

---

## Customisation

All logic is in the `<script>` block at the bottom of `index.html`. To change:

- **Calorie deficit/surplus** — edit the `500` and `300` values in the `calculate()` function
- **Protein target** — change `2.2` (grams per kg) in the same function
- **Exercise list** — edit the `buildSplitDetail()` function
- **Colors/theme** — edit the CSS variables in `:root` at the top of the `<style>` block

